Data notice (not covered by the MIT licence above)

The SPEI data in data/clean/ and data/raw/, the boundary files in
data/clean/geo/, and the numbers shown in the figures and reports are derived
from the "Drought Atlas of India, 1901-2025" (version 2) by Chuphal, D. S.,
Kushwaha, A. P., Aadhar, S. and Mishra, V., published on Zenodo
(https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20368514) under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Reuse of that data must credit
the original authors. Our changes: cleaned names, selected the state and Odisha
district series, computed drought flags, events, rankings and trends, and
simplified the boundary shapes.
